"description":"Doctor Notes by NuriQ helps you remember what matters, feel more prepared for your next appointment, and keep your whole care team on the same page.\n\nDownload Doctor Notes today and keep every doctor visit, hospital stay, and urgent care trip organized in one simple app.\n\nDoctor Notes is a medical visit recorder and notes app built for patients and families, so you can record doctor visits and get clear written summaries to review and share.\nRecord your doctor visits, hospital consults, telehealth calls, emergency room and urgent care visits, then replay and read what was said in simple language.\nDoctor Notes is for patients, caregivers, and busy families who don't want to forget the plan after a visit.\nWith Doctor Notes, you can:\n\n• Record doctor visits with a secure voice recorder\n• Get automatic visit summaries in clear, everyday language\n• See diagnoses, tests, medications, and follow-up steps in one place\n• Turn long medical conversations into short visit notes you can actually review\n• Share important information with family, caregivers, or trusted friends\n• Revisit instructions before surgery, procedures, or treatment changes\n• Stay organized across clinics, hospitals, specialists, and telehealth visits\n\nPerfect for:\n\n• Cancer patients and families managing oncology visits, treatment plans, and specialist coordination\n• Dementia and Alzheimer's caregivers who need to capture and share every detail\n• Adult children supporting aging parents from a distance\n• Parents keeping track of pediatric visits and specialist appointments\n• Patients juggling multiple doctors, hospital stays, or chronic conditions\n• Caregivers who need accurate doctor notes after every appointment and emergency visit\n\nKey features:\n\n• Smart visit summaries – clear doctor notes from your recorded appointment\n• Medical transcription – audio from your visit turned into searchable text\n• Visit history – keep all your visit records and summaries in one app\n• Family sharing – invite loved ones so everyone can see the same visit notes\n• Multilingual support – summaries available in multiple languages where supported\n\nDoctor Notes helps you remember what matters, feel more prepared for your next appointment, and keep your whole care team on the same page.\nDownload Doctor Notes today and keep every doctor visit, hospital stay, and urgent care trip organized in one simple app.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"54626304", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":8, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.5, "sellerUrl":"https://getdoctornotes.com/", "userRatingCount":8}, 
