"releaseNotes":"Introducing a more complete, connected Chartnote.\n\n• Work across devices. Record on your phone and continue on your computer. Your in-progress work and recordings stay in sync.\n\n• Record now, finish later. New Highlights summarize your visit so far, helping you pick up where you left off. Resume recording or generate your note whenever you’re ready.\n\n• Recover deleted notes. Restore notes from Trash for up to 30 days.\n\n• Keep your workspace organized. Move finished notes to Archive without deleting them.\n\n• Collaborate with your team. Chartnote Teams includes one assistant seat per clinician at no extra cost. Assistants can record intake and hand it off so you can continue the visit and complete the note.\n\nThank you for making Chartnote part of your day.", "averageUserRating":4.84121999999999985675458447076380252838134765625, "trackCensoredName":"Chartnote: AI Medical Scribe", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chartnote-ai-medical-scribe/id1589970506?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "price":0.00, "genres":["Medical", "Productivity"], "artistId":1548963114, "artistName":"StatNote Inc", "bundleId":"com.chartnote.chartnote-mobile", "releaseDate":"2022-01-16T08:00:00Z", "trackId":1589970506, "trackName":"Chartnote: AI Medical Scribe", "genreIds":["6020", "6007"], "minimumOsVersion":"15.6", "primaryGenreName":"Medical", "primaryGenreId":6020, "sellerName":"StatNote, Inc.", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-01T13:00:56Z", "version":"4.0.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Chartnote Mobile – AI Scribe for Medical Documentation\n\nTurn patient conversations into complete clinical notes—automatically.\n\nChartnote’s AI Scribe listens during patient encounters and generates accurate, structured medical notes in seconds. Whether you’re in clinic, hospital, or on the go, Chartnote helps you document faster and spend more time with patients.\n\nAI Scribe (Core Feature):\nAutomatically generates SOAP notes from patient conversations\nDesigned for real clinical workflows\nReduces charting time and after-hours documentation\n\nMedical Dictation & Voice Chart:\nHigh-accuracy medical speech-to-text\nDictate notes or capture full encounters\nWorks seamlessly across specialties\n\nSmart Templates & Snippets:\nCreate and customize your own note structure and style\nAccess thousands of medical snippets or dot phrases\nSpeed up repetitive documentation\n\nBuilt for Clinicians\nFamily Medicine, Emergency, Internal Medicine, Urgent Care, and more\nUse at bedside, between patients, or after clinic\nSecure and reliable for healthcare workflows\n\nGet Started Free\n\nBasic includes:\n15 AI Scribe notes per month\nTransfer notes into any web-based EMR\nCustom templates & smart snippets\n\nExisting users can upgrade to Chartnote Pro or Max.\n\nChartnote Pro\nUp to 100 AI Scribe notes per month\nUnlimited Copilot tools\n\nChartnote Max\nUnlimited AI Scribe notes\n\nSubscription Details:\nBefore completing payment, you'll see the plan price, charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase and on renewal, varying by plan and country.\nSubscriptions renew monthly or yearly, depending on your plan. Avoid auto-renewal by turning it off at least 24 hours before your subscription renews in your iTunes account settings. Manage and cancel subscriptions via the App Store account settings after purchase.\n\nWhat Clinicians are Saying:\n\"it has been a game changer in managing my patient's care.\"\n“Chartnote is super helpful in writing notes. It will save you a significant amount of time.”\n\nJoin our Community:\nWe'd love to hear from you! Send feedback, comments, or requests for technical support via our help page: https://help.chartnote.com.\n\nUseful Links:\nTerms of Use: https://chartnote.com/termsofuse\nPrivacy Policy: https://chartnote.com/privacypolicy", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"34549760", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":592, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.84121999999999985675458447076380252838134765625, "sellerUrl":"https://chartnote.com/", "userRatingCount":592}, 
