"description":"Doctor visits can be overwhelming. You may leave the appointment thinking you understood everything, only to later forget the medication instructions, follow-up plan, test results, or what your doctor actually said.\n\nMyDoctorSaid helps you remember.\n\nMyDoctorSaid is an AI-powered medical visit assistant that lets patients record their doctor visits, generate speech-to-text transcripts, and review clear summaries of the conversation afterward.\n\nWhether you are managing a chronic condition, helping a family member, tracking medication changes, or simply trying to understand your care plan, MyDoctorSaid gives you a reliable way to revisit the important details of your appointment.\n\nWith MyDoctorSaid, you can:\n\n* Record medical visits\n* Generate speech-to-text transcripts\n* Review AI-powered visit summaries\n* Ask questions based on your recorded visit\n* Remember medication instructions\n* Track follow-up steps and doctor recommendations\n* Support English and Spanish conversations\n\nMyDoctorSaid is built for patients, families, and caregivers who want more clarity after medical appointments.\n\nYour doctor’s words matter. Now you can remember them.\n\nImportant: MyDoctorSaid does not replace your doctor, diagnose medical conditions, or provide independent medical advice. Always follow the guidance of your licensed healthcare professional.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"33297408", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "userRatingCount":1}, 
