"description":"Your Doctors Online: 24/7 Care, No Wait\nSkip the waiting room! Get instant access to doctors, prescriptions, and mental health support – anytime, anywhere.\nTired of waiting weeks for a doctor's appointment? Need a prescription refill at midnight? Your Doctors Online is your solution for fast, convenient, and personalized healthcare.\n\nHere's what makes us different:\n\nInstant Access, Zero Wait Time: Connect with board-certified physicians 24/7. No appointments needed, ever. Get the care you need, RIGHT NOW, from the comfort of your home.\nHealthcare Made Easy: Need a prescription, sick note, or lab work? We've got you covered. Manage your health with just a few taps on your phone.\nLive Longer, Live Better: Our doctors don't just treat illness—they help you PREVENT it. We'll analyze your health and provide personalized guidance to achieve your wellness goals, helping you live a longer, healthier life.\nMental Health, Your Way: Access mental health providers 24/7, easily switch providers until you find your perfect fit, and enjoy unlimited offline conversations for ongoing support. Your mental well-being is our top priority.\nFamily Sharing Plan: Easily share your subscription with family members. Ensure your entire family has convenient access to healthcare and mental health support under a single plan.\n\nYour Doctors Online is perfect for:\nBusy professionals who can't afford to miss work for appointments.\nFamilies seeking convenient and affordable healthcare.\nIndividuals in remote areas with limited access to doctors.\nAnyone prioritizing proactive health and a longer, healthier life.\nIndividuals seeking accessible, convenient mental health support, with the freedom to switch providers until they find the perfect fit.\n\nDownload the app today and experience healthcare on your terms!\n\nIs our service secure?\nOur foremost priority is to ensure your safety and security. We safeguard your data by encrypting it thoroughly, testing it frequently, using account security measures, and implementing other procedures and policies in line with the highest industry standards. Your medical history is only accessible by you and our medical team serving you.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://yourdoctors.online/privacy-policy/\nTerms of Service:\nhttps://yourdoctors.online/terms-of-service/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"110877696", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":5020, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.53028000000000030667024475405924022197723388671875, "sellerUrl":"http://yourdoctors.online", "userRatingCount":5020}]
